<title>USA: Resource files $450 mln debt/equity shelf.</title>
<headline>Resource files $450 mln debt/equity shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Resource Mortgage Capital filed Monday a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission for up to $450 million in debt, stocks and warrants.</p>
<p>The Glen Allen, Va.,-based company said net proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
